      <a href="#pain-points" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-500/15 border border-rose-400/40 hover:border-rose-300 text-rose-200 transition">⚡ {isZhCN ? "根治原生终端 8 大痛点 ↓" : "8 Native Terminal Pain Points Solved ↓"}</a>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-notion-surface/90 border border-notion-border text-sky-300">⚔️ {isZhCN ? "Fleet Arena · Worktree 零冲突并发" : "Fleet Arena · Zero-Conflict Worktrees"}</span>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-notion-surface/90 border border-notion-border text-purple-300">📊 {isZhCN ? "Token / 费用水位预警 · 一键 /compact" : "Token & Cost HUD · 1-Click /compact"}</span>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-notion-surface/90 border border-notion-border text-amber-300">🔍 {isZhCN ? "内嵌 Diff 审查 · 隐藏检查点无损回滚" : "Inline Diff · Hidden Checkpoints"}</span>
      <a href="#unzoo" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-notion-surface/90 border border-amber-400/40 hover:border-amber-300 text-amber-200 transition">🦁 {isZhCN ? "Unzoo Browser 前端自愈联动 ↗" : "Unzoo Browser Self-Healing ↗"}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
