</section>

<!-- ============== 8 NATIVE TERMINAL PAIN POINTS SOLVED ============== -->
<section id="pain-points" class="py-20 border-t border-notion-border relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-rose-400">
        {isZhCN ? "WHY UNTERM · 专为 CLAUDE CODE / CODEX / AGY CLI 而生" : "WHY UNTERM · PURPOSE-BUILT FOR CLAUDE CODE, CODEX & AGY CLI"}
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-notion-ink text-balance">
        {isZhCN
          ? "传统原生终端跑 AI Coding CLI 的 8 大痛点，Unterm 逐个根治。"
          : "8 native terminal pain points when running AI Coding CLIs—solved at the kernel."}
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-notion-muted leading-relaxed">
        {isZhCN
          ? "Terminal.app、Windows Terminal、iTerm2 和传统 Electron 终端都是为“人工敲一行、看一屏输出”设计的。当你全天候运行 Claude Code、Codex CLI 与 Antigravity (agy) 时，底层瓶颈立刻暴露——下面每一项，都是 Unterm 实打实修掉的核心痛点。"
          : "Terminal.app, Windows Terminal, iTerm2, and Electron terminals were designed for one command at a time. The moment you run Claude Code, Codex CLI, and Antigravity (agy) all day, every legacy bottleneck surfaces—here is every pain point Unterm eliminates."}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-notion-border bg-notion-surface/60 p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-300 bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/25 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
            {isZhCN ? "痛点 01 · 打字卡顿 / 掉字 / IME 吞字" : "PAIN 01 · TYPING LAG, DROPPED KEYS & IME GLITCHES"}
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">✓ &lt;2ms 输入</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-notion-muted leading-relaxed">
          {isZhCN
            ? "在 Windows 与高负载多会话下，传统终端打字发粘、快敲掉字、中文输入法切窗后残留幽灵拼音。"
            : "Under heavy agent output or Windows 15.6ms timer quantization, typing feels sticky, rapid keystrokes drop, and CJK IME compositions get stranded."}
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-notion-ink leading-relaxed border-t border-notion-border/70 pt-3">
          <strong class="text-emerald-300">{isZhCN ? "Unterm 解法：" : "Unterm Fix: "}</strong>
          {isZhCN
            ? "独立非阻塞合并输入线程（unterm-input-tx）+ Windows 1ms 系统时钟 + DX12 Mailbox 零帧排队 + Win32 WM_CHAR 孤儿字符回收与 IME 自动自愈，后台跑满 8 个 Agent 打字依然跟手。"
            : "Dedicated non-blocking coalescing input worker (unterm-input-tx), Windows 1ms timer resolution, DX12 Mailbox 1-frame latency, Win32 WM_CHAR recovery, and automatic orphan IME cleanup."}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-notion-border bg-notion-surface/60 p-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-300 bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/25 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
            {isZhCN ? "痛点 02 · 全屏 TUI 闪屏、撕裂与快捷键失效" : "PAIN 02 · TUI TEARING, FLICKER & BROKEN CHORDS"}
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">✓ ?2026 + Kitty</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-notion-muted leading-relaxed">
          {isZhCN
            ? "Claude Code / Agy 高频刷屏时边框错位重影、拖窄窗口文字被截断、Shift+Enter 换行直接误发送。"
            : "High-frequency TUI redraws tear boxes and flicker, resizing clips wrapped lines, and Shift+Enter accidentally submits prompts instead of inserting newlines."}
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-notion-ink leading-relaxed border-t border-notion-border/70 pt-3">
          <strong class="text-emerald-300">{isZhCN ? "Unterm 解法：" : "Unterm Fix: "}</strong>
          {isZhCN
            ? "纯 Rust GPU 渲染引擎完整实现 ?2026 同步输出（原子帧提交）、主屏软换行 Reflow、ECMA-48 宽字符精确切分与 Kitty 键盘协议 / modifyOtherKeys。"
            : "Pure-Rust GPU renderer with global ?2026 synchronized output, main-screen resize reflow, ECMA-48 CJK wide-cell splitting, and Kitty keyboard protocol + modifyOtherKeys."}
        </p>
