            ? "Windows 下打开 Agent、跑 MCP 或后台查 Git 状态时桌面频繁一闪而过 cmd 黑框，甚至按 Ctrl+C 带崩后台会话。"
            : "Launching agents, MCP bridges, or background Git probes flashes stray cmd/OpenConsole windows on Windows, and Ctrl+C can drop the background Core."}
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-notion-ink leading-relaxed border-t border-notion-border/70 pt-3">
